    {
      "id": "uRdel-94yg1drdP9nH4NE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 218.359375,
      "y": 340.109375,
      "width": 378.4007873535156,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 95000717,
      "version": 600,
      "versionNonce": 1618815696,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787466854147,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- Create short URL from long URL\n    - Create custom URL\n    - Add expiration time to the URL\n- Access long URL from short URL\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n- Scale to support 1B short URLs & 100M DAU\n- Unique short URLs (5 - 7 chars)\n- Minimal delay on redirection (~ < 100ms)\n- High availability & eventual consistency\n\nRead > write\n~ 1000 reads for 1 write",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- Create short URL from long URL\n    - Create custom URL\n    - Add expiration time to the URL\n- Access long URL from short URL\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n- Scale to support 1B short URLs & 100M DAU\n- Unique short URLs (5 - 7 chars)\n- Minimal delay on redirection (~ < 100ms)\n- High availability & eventual consistency\n\nRead > write\n~ 1000 reads for 1 write",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vKOc5m-2XjmNaA3_CJY3m",
