        {
          "id": "W9AiVq08d0OkPF7IP7D6X",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1787467130280,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "POST Req\n1. Validate the original URL\n2. Check with the DB if the same Original URL exists\n   (optional, need to check with interviewer)\n    - If yes, return the short URL\n    - else generate a new URL\n3. Generate the Short URL (or use custom alias)\n4. Store the data in DB",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "POST Req\n1. Validate the original URL\n2. Check with the DB if the same Original URL exists\n   (optional, need to check with interviewer)\n    - If yes, return the short URL\n    - else generate a new URL\n3. Generate the Short URL (or use custom alias)\n4. Store the data in DB",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZPsCQ7_56gJC7V9l28LVK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 912.7126428779236,
      "y": 1004.6933264888366,
      "width": 492.79998779296875,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "af",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 804851299,
      "version": 1512,
      "versionNonce": 293147629,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "QSLiY7CVvmpxhgIa_MQax",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1783428629667,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GET Request\n1. Validate the short URL\n2. Fetch the long URL from DB using the short URL\n3. If the short URL has expiry,\n   check if current date is smaller than expiry date\n   - if true, Do a http 302 redirect to the original URL\n   - else, send an error with 410 Gone status",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GET Request\n1. Validate the short URL\n2. Fetch the long URL from DB using the short URL\n3. If the short URL has expiry,\n   check if current date is smaller than expiry date\n   - if true, Do a http 302 redirect to the original URL\n   - else, send an error with 410 Gone status",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9H2jiJT2XytCBcsHCJN_X",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1416.1768111642652,
      "y": 315.46494406474807,
      "width": 580.80126953125,
      "height": 320,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "afV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 312083949,
      "version": 2602,
      "versionNonce": 145194544,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "W9AiVq08d0OkPF7IP7D6X",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1787467787591,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Generate Unique Short URLs\nrequirements\n- it should be short (8 chars)\n- should be unique\n- efficient generation\n- 8 base 62 chars: 62^8 ~= 218 trillion opts\n\nmethod 1: Use a hash function\ninput url: https://domain.com/long/url\nnormalUrl = normalize(url) --> lowercase it, remove training / etc\nhashed = hash(normalUrl + salt)\nencodedUrl = encode_base62(hashed)\nshortCode = encodedUrl[0:8] --> first 8 chars\nIMP: there are still chances of collision, so\n- we check the DB before after generating a short code\n- Check for 4 - 5 times before failing the creation",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Generate Unique Short URLs\nrequirements\n- it should be short (8 chars)\n- should be unique\n- efficient generation\n- 8 base 62 chars: 62^8 ~= 218 trillion opts\n\nmethod 1: Use a hash function\ninput url: https://domain.com/long/url\nnormalUrl = normalize(url) --> lowercase it, remove training / etc\nhashed = hash(normalUrl + salt)\nencodedUrl = encode_base62(hashed)\nshortCode = encodedUrl[0:8] --> first 8 chars\nIMP: there are still chances of collision, so\n- we check the DB before after generating a short code\n- Check for 4 - 5 times before failing the creation",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
