    {
      "id": "HlWNtIDmufAB53eHfGRgC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2157.6645149670494,
      "y": 1402.3524247849605,
      "width": 536.7999877929688,
      "height": 220,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "at",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1440850723,
      "version": 339,
      "versionNonce": 1220426819,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783431248878,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "100 bytes per row / document\n1B * 500 bytes\n10^9 * 500 = 5 * 10^11 = 500 GB\n\nSo 500 GB is something which modern DB can handle very easily\nSo 1 DB instance will do for now\nif required later it can be sharded\n\nAvailability of DB\n- Replication\n- Data backup",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "100 bytes per row / document\n1B * 500 bytes\n10^9 * 500 = 5 * 10^11 = 500 GB\n\nSo 500 GB is something which modern DB can handle very easily\nSo 1 DB instance will do for now\nif required later it can be sharded\n\nAvailability of DB\n- Replication\n- Data backup",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
